do Tutorial.stop_highlight()
Grandpapi: If a company has no no-do-gooders in them, then it will make $100 each quarter. [#v16]
Grandpapi: However...if a company has a no-do-gooder in it...it will make no profit. [#v17]
Grandpapi: Not only that. If you put a do-gooder in my company, you will lose an additional $100 because I'll get angry. [#v18]
Grandpapi: These will add up in costs. [#v19]
Grandpapi: Once you run out of money, you will lose the level. [#v20]
Grandpapi: Close the statement. [#v21]
